# Response headers this app needs, folded into its generated Caddy block by
# /opt/scripts/deploy.sh.
#
# Godot 4's web export is built with thread support, so the runtime asks for
# SharedArrayBuffer, and a browser only hands that out to a cross-origin
# isolated document. Without both of these the page loads and then stops with
# "The following features required to run Godot projects on the Web are
# missing: Threads".
#
# Everything the page fetches is same-origin, so require-corp costs nothing
# here. There are no third-party embeds, no analytics and no external fonts;
# adding any would need a Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy on the other end.
header Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy "same-origin"
header Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy "require-corp"
